\ Bounded-memory regression for transient bignum results on the main task.
\
\ A bignum produced by arithmetic used to land its box and limb array on the
\ context arena, which is never reclaimed on the main task, so this loop grew
\ monotonically and exhausted the 4 MB cap set in the `.flags` sidecar partway
\ through. Bignum payloads now carry refcounted heap backings, so a dropped
\ result is freed at the drop and the loop stays flat.

20000 [ 99999999999999999999999 12345 + drop ] times
20000 [ 12345678901234567890 98765432109876543210 * drop ] times

"flat" print-line
